 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "If you blocked this one protein,",
   "emph": [
    "protein"
   ],
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 1.73,
   "show": 0.0,
   "hide": 1.89
  },
  {
   "text": "your muscles could grow WAY bigger.",
   "emph": [
    "way",
    "bigger"
   ],
   "start": 1.93,
   "end": 3.87,
   "show": 1.89,
   "hide": 4.05
  },
  {
   "text": "It's called myostatin,",
   "emph": [
    "myostatin"
   ],
   "start": 4.09,
   "end": 5.33,
   "show": 4.05,
   "hide": 5.3
  },
  {
   "text": "and it acts like a brake on muscle growth.",
   "emph": [
    "brake"
   ],
   "start": 5.34,
   "end": 7.21,
   "show": 5.3,
   "hide": 7.39
  },
  {
   "text": "But some animals are born without that brake.",
   "emph": [
    "brake"
   ],
   "start": 7.43,
   "end": 9.56,
   "show": 7.39,
   "hide": 9.75
  },
  {
   "text": "And their muscles grow freakishly huge.",
   "emph": [
    "freakishly",
    "huge"
   ],
   "start": 9.79,
   "end": 12.29,
   "show": 9.75,
   "hide": 12.48
  },
  {
   "text": "Scientists are even developing drugs",
   "emph": [
    "drugs"
   ],
   "start": 12.52,
   "end": 14.28,
   "show": 12.48,
   "hide": 14.245
  },
  {
   "text": "that block it in humans.",
   "emph": [
    "humans"
   ],
   "start": 14.285,
   "end": 15.57,
   "show": 14.245,
   "hide": 15.88
  },
  {
   "text": "But here's the weird part.",
   "emph": [
    "weird"
   ],
   "start": 15.92,
   "end": 17.42,
   "show": 15.88,
   "hide": 17.67
  },
  {
   "text": "Bigger muscles don't always mean more strength.",
   "emph": [
    "strength"
   ],
   "start": 17.71,
   "end": 19.78,
   "show": 17.67,
   "hide": 19.96
  },
  {
   "text": "So you could end up looking superhuman",
   "emph": [
    "superhuman"
   ],
   "start": 20.0,
   "end": 22.2,
   "show": 19.96,
   "hide": 22.17
  },
  {
   "text": "without actually being super strong.",
   "emph": [
    "strong"
   ],
   "start": 22.21,
   "end": 24.08,
   "show": 22.17,
   "hide": 24.567
  }
 ],
